    <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">This program may be used to read out image data from all scanners of the FujiFilm BAS series (BAS1000, BAS1500, BAS1800, BAS2000, BAS2500, BAS3000, BAS5000) and the FujiFilm FLA scanners (FLA-2000, FLA-3000).</obo:IAO_0000115>
