    <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">The package implements a method for normalising microarray intensities, both between colours within array, and between arrays. The method uses a robust variant of the maximum-likelihood estimator for the stochastic model of microarray data described in the references</obo:IAO_0000115>
