    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">VCell</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The licensing issue is not clear. On the VCell wikipedia page, the source is described as having an MIT license (see http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Virtual_Cell, accessed 26 March 2015). However, the exact type of license is not mentioned on the VCell homepage (http://www.vcell.org), therefore I have not added the statement that the MIT license is the *only* license for VCell.</rdfs:comment>
