  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SWO_0000653">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">pdInfoBuilder</rdfs:label>
    <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Builds platform design information packages. These consist of a SQLite database containing feature-level data such as x, y position on chip and featureSet ID. The database also incorporates featureSet-level annotation data. The products of this packages are used by the oligo pkg.</obo:IAO_0000115>
