    <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">The affy package contains functions for exploratory oligonucleotide array analysis. The dependance to tkWidgets only concerns few convenience functions. 'affy' is fully functional without it.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </rdf:Description>
