    <dcterms:creator>Nandini Badarinarayan</dcterms:creator>
    <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">SAFE is a resampling-based method for testing functional categories is gene expression experiments. SAFE can be applied to 2-sample and multi-class comparisons, or simple linear regressions. Other experimental designs can also be accommodated through user-defined functions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
