    <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">COBRA (COnstraint-Based Reconstruction and Analysis Toolbox) includes implementations of many of the commonly used forms of constraint-based analysis such as FBA, gene deletions, flux variability analysis, sampling, and batch simulations together with tools to read in and manipulate constraint-based models.</obo:IAO_0000115>
