  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SWO_1100006">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SWO_0000001"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="Nde89ae8bd30844b080800d190ff7afe3"/>
    <obo:IAO_0000119>http://www.raytest.de/index2.html</obo:IAO_0000119>
    <obo:IAO_0000119>AIDA is a modular software package for evaluation and documentation of images that were obtained with digital devices such as CCD cameras, flat bed scanners, or BAS / FLA- scanners from Fuji. Additionally, AIDA allows the loading of loading a variety of images in other image formats (e.g.: TIFF, JPEG, Bmp, gel). AIDA can control all scanning devices offering a TWAIN compatible driver.</obo:IAO_0000119>
    <dcterms:creator>Nandini Badarinarayan</dcterms:creator>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">AIDA</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N1fdbf05fb68a4edcb5addbfc1c3d2483">
