  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SWO_0000532">
    <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">This package provides a set of tools for analyzing data from a factorial designed microarray experiment, or any microarray experiment for which a linear model is appropriate. The functions can be used to evaluate tests of contrast of biological interest and perform single outlier detection.</obo:IAO_0000115>
