    <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">The lumi package provides an integrated solution for the Illumina microarray data analysis. It includes functions of Illumina BeadStudio data input, quality control, BeadArray-specific variance stabilization, normalization and gene annotation at the probe level.</obo:IAO_0000115>
