    <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Framework for processing and visualization of chromatographically separated and single-spectra mass spectral data. Imports from AIA/ANDI NetCDF, mzXML, and mzData files. Preprocesses data for high-throughput, untargeted analyte profiling.</obo:IAO_0000115>
