    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">cosmoGUI allows the user to interactively define constraint sets that can be used by the cosmo package to supervise the search for shared motifs in a set of DNA sequences. The constraints can be either adapted from a set of commonly used templates or defined from scratch.</obo:IAO_0000115>
