    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">affyContam</rdfs:label>
    <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">affyContam is software which provides the in silico creation of quality problems in CEL-level data to help evaluate performance of quality metrics. In essence, it creates structured corruption within CEL data to demonstrate QA effectiveness.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </rdf:Description>
